sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Claimant
  participant S as Session runner
  participant C as Challenge
  participant E as Emitter (screen)
  participant A as Acoustic (spk+mic)
  participant K as Keystroke capture
  participant O as Optical lane
  participant F as Fusion / Adjudicator
  U->>S: start verification
  S->>C: new Challenge(seed = random)
  S->>S: lock exposure, warm-up, measure fps
  S->>C: pick_auto_chip_rate(fps)
  par Concurrent challenge window
    S->>E: drive border pattern (log every redraw)
    E-->>U: modulated light on face
    S->>A: play BPSK probe, record duplex
    A-->>U: 4 kHz probe tone
    S->>K: start listener, show phrase
    U->>K: types phrase (timing only stored)
    loop every camera frame
      U-->>S: reflected light in frame
      S->>O: process_frame(frame, t)
    end
  end
  S->>O: finalize() → score, lag, SNR
  S->>A: detect_probe() → score, lag, SNR
  S->>K: keystroke_normality_score()
  S->>F: adjudicate_two_lane(optical, typing, acoustic)
  F-->>S: verdict + reason_text
  S->>S: write JSON log
  S-->>U: ACCEPT / RE-CHALLENGE / REJECT banner
